{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:01 2026-07-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:01 2026-07-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:01 2026-07-06 HKT</p><p>解放軍導彈驅逐艦「南寧艦」、導彈護衛艦「衡陽艦」組成的海軍艦艇編隊本月2日來港，兩艘軍艦今早（6日）從昂船洲軍港離開，駛離香港水域。早上9時許，「衡陽艦」率先啟航離開，岸上的海陸空官兵代表列隊送別，艦上官兵則向岸邊揮手致意，軍樂隊奏樂歡送，至於導彈驅逐艦「南寧艦」則預計於10時半駛離昂船洲。</p><img alt=\"導彈護衛艦「衡陽艦」早上9時許率先啟航離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a557d87389a798a8e05b1878907484f/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592.jpg\"/><img alt=\"岸上的海陸空官兵代表列隊送別。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0fc3c3a09254bd9139ce12fb6cc9c7e7/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"艦上官兵則向岸邊揮手致意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70533073a0110c9f4872aff3f886b059/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"岸上的海陸空官兵代表列隊送別。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/02c83bea43be1ed0c73e5c6164666473/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"艦上官兵向岸邊揮手致意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0933ddf720fca82dd70094b6750b6d2/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_04.jpg\"/><img alt=\"解放軍導彈驅逐艦「南寧艦」、導彈護衛艦「衡陽艦」組成的海軍艦艇編隊本月2日來港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e384b9bfb8e40d8c1d944d85f5c9c5f1/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_05.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「衡陽艦」率先啟航離開，岸上的海陸空官兵代表列隊送別。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8041e6b1102ce666ee378e7ddd624133/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_06.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「衡陽艦」率先啟航離開，岸上的海陸空官兵代表列隊送別。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc3b0fe1ac73cab48a0f0916804e920e/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_07.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「衡陽艦」率先啟航離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00d4dee18a310e82e401e3f9115db8e2/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_08.jpg\"/><img alt=\"軍樂隊奏樂歡送。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf127f3bebb985843b3f7f648655a5c2/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_09.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f315b4538be411da0cbb430237ce09bf/2026-07/KakaoTalk_20260706_093021592_10.jpg\"/><p>攝影：陳浩元</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T02:19:25.774793+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}